          "type": "liquid",
          "settings": {
            "code": "<div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"row mb-5\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-8\">\n                <img id=\"er_mb\" class=\"d-block d-md-none\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0558/7937/files/roosevelt_updated_web.png?v=1679575553\" alt=\"We Have Purpose\">\n                <p>Former First Lady Eleanor Roosevelt serves as Rebel Nell’s day-in and day-out inspiration for her tireless devotion to women’s rights and civil rights activism.</p>\n\n                    <p>Known as ‘Little Nell’, in her younger years, we put a more badass spin on her nickname and hence Rebel Nell was born.</p>\n                    \n                   <p> The women employed by Rebel Nell are rebelling against what society has handed them and forging a new future for themselves and their families.\n                    </p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-4\">\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"container-fluid py-4 mb-5\" style=\"background:#eef0f6;padding-top:1rem;\">\n        <div class=\"container er_section\">\n            <div class=\"row\">\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-8 text-center d-flex align-items-center\">\n                    <div class=\"align-self-center\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n                        <h2>\"FOR OUR SUCCESS TO BE REAL, IT MUST <br class=\"d-xs-none d-sm-none d-md-inline\"> CONTRIBUTE TO THE SUCCESS OF OTHERS.\"</h2>\n                        <p>-Eleanor Roosevelt</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-4 position-relative\">\n                    <img id=\"er_img\" class=\"d-none d-md-block\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0558/7937/files/roosevelt_updated_web.png?v=1679575553\" alt=\"We Have Purpose\">\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>",
